  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In The Legends of Ren Zu, cognition Gu tells Desolate Ancient Moon that climbing Cheng Bai mountain and finding the one and only success Gu lets her make a wish that rescues Ren Zu and allows him to resurrect. Cheng Bai mountain is a mound of countless pebbles that are failure Gu, with only one success Gu at the peak.",
        "chapters": [
          435
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_the_legends_of_ren_zu",
          "gu_cognition_gu",
          "char_desolate_ancient_moon",
          "loc_cheng_bai_mountain",
          "char_ren_zu",
          "gu_failure_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After love Gu topples Cheng Bai mountain, Desolate Ancient Moon must search rock by rock for the real success Gu. Cognition Gu says success Gu was at the peak and failure Gu at the bottom, that failure is the mother of success, and that the scattered rocks are success Gu’s siblings. Holding failure Gu would leave her completely lost and in danger of dying. When only two rocks remain, one is success Gu and one is failure Gu; she picks failure Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          547
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cheng-bai-search",
